{"3349300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Paragliding Simulator", "steam_appid": 3349300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Paragliding Simulator</strong> delivers the ultimate free-flight experience. Developed by an experienced paragliding pilot, it accurately recreates the dynamics of flight with soft-body wing physics and dynamic winds—offering endless possibilities for exploration and skill-building gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wings:</strong> Choose from a wide range of wings right from the start, from nimble speed wings to high-aspect racing gliders. With the built-in wing editor, you can even design and fine-tune your own custom wing from scratch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Harnesses:</strong> Mix and match any harness with any wing—whether it’s a lightweight setup, a powered paramotor, or a trike. For even more variety, try fun options like the kiting buggy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349300/extras/88047e87fca295743a29517ce149ae2d.avif?t=1757098633\" width=1024 height=512 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Winds:</strong> From soaring to long-distance thermal cross-country flights, anything is possible. Adjust your wind settings, and the simulator will accurately generate ridge lift, rotor, and thermals for realistic flight conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Paragliding Simulator</strong> delivers the ultimate free-flight experience. Developed by an experienced paragliding pilot, it accurately recreates the dynamics of flight with soft-body wing physics and dynamic winds—offering endless possibilities for exploration and skill-building gameplay.</p><p